855074d4a","cmd-6a56eb231d544764","cmd-9a5a0d6f6f41448a","cmd-6e45ca5c70a9441e","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.97,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.72,"summary":"Core testing mutations were causally relevant and bounded, and the mandatory restart was fully demonstrated. However, several unnecessary retained changes reduced hygiene: a consumer.py.pre-repair backup was created and never removed; testing created a stale consumer.pid and consumer.log in the task directory without cleanup; and a new persistent SysV service plus boot links was installed even though automatic startup was not part of the public contract. The latter also converted the testing log into permanent service state. No unsafe network exposure, package damage, or temporary-file residue was observed. The backup and test artifacts were low risk, while the retained system-wide autostart configuration was a broader unnecessary mutation.","evidence_ids":["cmd-9a5a0d6f6f41448a","cmd-82a13bf3d68a4a96","cmd-573503eec49c46a7","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The provider-wide restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, restart was acknowledged, connectivity was disrupted, a different boot ID was observed, and service behavior, retained data, FIFO state, OS release, and kernel were verified after recovery. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart. Operational hygiene is reduced by retained backup/test artifacts and an unnecessary persistent autostart service.","limitations":["The fixed lifecycle collector does not inventory /srv/legacy2/fifo-worker-reconnection or SysV init configuration, so retained artifact findings rely on the complete executor timeline and the absence of cleanup commands.","Failed-service collection was unsupported on this pre-systemd platform, although direct service checks, package health, listening-socket checks, and behavior tests were successful.","No final directory-wide listing was captured, so additional compiler-generated residue, if any, cannot be determined."]}
